        {
            "title": "〈台股風向球〉聯準會升息壓抑難脫整理格局 先靠績優股輪流維繫多頭火種",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"〈台股風向球〉聯準會升息壓抑難脫整理格局 先靠績優股輪流維繫多頭火種\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/93fb2dc43fb9e9d7dbc503a5bacd7e31e5ade136ef716157ccd6dc0787121c65/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F5f4cbcce1de9fa9050feed406c7535cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">〈台股風向球〉聯準會升息壓抑難脫整理格局 先靠績優股輪流維繫多頭火種</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
